Changes
=======

v4.0.4 24 July 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.2.0.

v4.0.3 1 July 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.1.0.

v4.0.2 7 May 2026
  * Pair the Ed448 algorithm with the Ed448 curve via
    `jws.RegisterAlgorithmForCurve`, mirroring main jwx's pattern
    for fully-specified EdDSA/EC algs. Without this, an Ed25519
    `jwk.Key` would advertise `Ed448` in its `jws.AlgorithmsForKey`
    list as a generic OKP algorithm. Defense-in-depth: existing
    type-strict dispatchers caught the resulting confusion one
    layer down, but the gate now lives at the algorithm/curve
    registration.

v4.0.1 28 Apr 2026
  * Validate raw Ed448 key lengths in the OKP raw-key importer (reject
    inputs whose length does not match Ed448 public/private key sizes).

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * First stable v4 release. Tracks github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 v4.0.0.

v4.0.0-alpha4 13 Apr 2026
  * Rename `ed448.Ed448Curve()` accessor to `ed448.Curve()` to avoid package-name stutter.

v4.0.0-alpha3 8 Apr 2026
  * Update to jwx/v4 API (generics, new registration functions).

v4.0.0-alpha2 8 Apr 2026
  * Bump jwx/v4 to v4.0.0-scratch.2.

v4.0.0-alpha1 8 Apr 2026
  * Initial version, extracted from github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx-circl-ed448.
